            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nDot-repeat with horizontal movement is mostly a coincidence as it uses `<` and `>` which are dot-repeatable. I didn't consider making single line movement dot-repeatable as it ergonomically is virtually similar as pressing default mappings while holding `Alt`/`Meta`.\r\n\r\nI'll look into it.",
