            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So I've looked into adding dot-repeat to mappings for moving current line and it is not that simple. Usual approach of setting `'operatorfunc'` and using expression mapping doesn't work right away here. The main reason seems to be that `move_line()` itself uses some dot-repeatable actions which override the main one.\r\n\r\nI'll give it another go, but my hopes are not high at the moment.",
